---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for our online tools." lang="en">
  <Header lang="en" />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      <p>Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-6">1. 100% Client-Side Processing</h2>
      <p>All the tools on this website run entirely in your web browser. Your files (images, PDFs) are processed locally on your device and are <strong>never uploaded</strong> to our servers. We do not have access to any of your files.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-6">2. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
      <p>We may use cookies to store your preferences (such as dark mode settings). Third-party ad networks (like Google AdSense) may also use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-6">3. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at: lonetrek@outlook.com</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer lang="en" />
</BaseLayout>